---
import { siteConfig } from "../../data/site-config";
import type { Locale } from "../../types/site";
import Container from "../ui/Container.astro";

interface Props {
  locale: Locale;
}
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const es = locale === "es";
const articleUrl = `${siteConfig.blogUrl}2026/09/como-nacio-quantix-una-promesa-que.html`;
const articleImage = "/images/blog/como-nacio-quantix.webp";
---

<section class="blog-section section" aria-labelledby="blog-title">
  <Container>
    <div class="blog-layout">
      <div class="blog-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">Quantix Blog</p>
        <h2 id="blog-title">
          {es ? "Detrás del software, hay una historia." : "Behind the software, there’s a story."}
        </h2>
        <p class="blog-description">
          {
            es
              ? "Ideas, tecnología y experiencias de los productos que construimos. Una mirada a cómo pensamos y trabajamos en Quantix."
              : "Ideas, technology and experiences from the products we build. A look at how we think and work at Quantix."
          }
        </p>
        <a class="blog-action" href={siteConfig.blogUrl}
          >{es ? "Explorar el blog" : "Explore the blog"}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
        >
      </div>
      <article class="blog-feature">
        <a class="article-link" href={articleUrl} aria-labelledby="featured-article-title">
          <div class="article-image">
            <img
              src={articleImage}
              alt=""
              width="1600"
              height="900"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="article-copy">
            <p class="article-meta">
              <span>{es ? "Nuestra historia" : "Our story"}</span><time datetime="2026-09-29"
                >{es ? "29 sep 2026" : "Sep 29, 2026"}</time
              >
            </p>
            <h3 id="featured-article-title" lang="es">
              Cómo nació Quantix: una promesa que comenzó desde el soporte
            </h3>
            <p class="article-excerpt">
              {
                es
                  ? "Las llamadas de soporte, los problemas que se repetían y una promesa: construir software que haga más sencillo el trabajo de las personas."
                  : "Support calls, recurring problems and a promise: to build software that makes people’s work easier."
              }
            </p>
            <span class="article-action"
              >{es ? "Leer la historia" : "Read the story"}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span
            >
            {!es && <span class="article-language">Article in Spanish</span>}
          </div>
        </a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>

<style>
  .blog-section {
    background: var(--color-surface-muted);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .blog-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.75fr) minmax(0, 1.25fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .blog-intro {
    padding-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  .blog-intro h2 {
    max-width: 17ch;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--text-section);
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .blog-description {
    max-width: 35ch;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 1rem;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
  }
  .blog-action,
  .article-action {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-height: 2.75rem;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 0.3em;
  }
  .blog-action span,
  .article-action span {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
  }
  .blog-action:hover,
  .article-link:is(:hover, :focus-visible) .article-action {
    color: var(--color-primary-hover);
  }
  .article-link {
    display: block;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .article-image {
    overflow: hidden;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    background: var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }
  .article-image img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .article-copy {
    padding-top: 1.25rem;
  }
  .article-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem 1.25rem;
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-label);
  }
  .article-meta span {
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .article-copy h3 {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 35ch;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 1.15rem + 1vw, 2rem);
    line-height: var(--leading-snug);
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .article-excerpt {
    max-width: 55ch;
    margin: 1rem 0 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
  }
  .article-language {
    display: block;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    font-size: var(--text-label);
  }
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .blog-layout {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 2rem;
    }
    .blog-intro h2 {
      max-width: 24ch;
    }
    .blog-description {
      max-width: 48ch;
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }
    .blog-intro {
      padding-top: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
